## 12. Test Data JSON Format

### File Organization

| File | Contents |
|------|----------|
| `SingleRuleTest.json` | BS, AS, SR single-rule tests |
| `DailyOvertimeRuleTest.json` | DOT single-rule tests |
| `WeeklyOvertimeTest.json` | WOT single-rule tests |
| `DoubleRuleTest.json` | All 2-rule combinations |
| `SpecificRangeRuleTest.json` | SR single-rule tests |
| `NoRuleTest.json` | No custom rules (regular hours only) |
| `UnallocatedHoursCalculations/UnallocatedHoursTestData.json` | Unallocated hours tests (`isUnplannedHoursPayEnabled: 1`) |
| `MonthlyCalculationsTest.json` | Monthly timesheet tests (`start_of_month` variations) |

### JSON Structure
```json
{
  "singleRule": [ ... ]     // or "doubleRule" for DoubleRuleTest.json
}
```

### Test Object Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `testId` | string | Unique ID: `RULE_COMBO_NNN` or `RULE_COMBO_BPN_NNN` |
| `method` | string | Always `"Shift"` |
| `frequency` | string | Always `"Weekly"` |
| `start of the week` | string | Always `"[mon]"` |
| `dayPattern` | string | Days with regular hours: `"[mon,tue,wed,thu,fri]"` |
| `regularHours` | string | Scheduled range: `"9:00-17:00"` |
| `_comment` | string | Human-readable calculation breakdown |
| `rulesApplied` | string | Rule configuration (see format per rule type) |
| `actualWorkTime` | string | Work entries per day |
| `breakTime` | string | Break entries (empty for NoBrk) |
| `acceptedPayBillRate` | string | Daily pay/bill breakdown (includes `unallocatedHours` when enabled) |
| `weeklyOT` | string | Weekly OT pay/bill (only when WOT rule present) |
| `overtimeHours` | string | Daily overtime hours: `"week1:[Mon:2, Tue:3]"` (see Section 9) |
| `totalOvertimeHours` | number | Sum of all daily OT hours (excludes WOT) |
| `weeklyOvertimeHours` | string | Weekly OT hours: `"week1:4"` (WOT only, see Section 9) |
| `breakBillable` | string | `""` (NoBrk), `"Yes"` (BPY), `"No"` (BPN) |
| `breakTimeThreshold` | number | Anticipated break in seconds (0 for NoBrk/BPY) |
| `payRate` | number | Base pay rate (typically 1) |
| `billRate` | number | Base bill rate (typically 2) |
| `expectedTotalPayRate` | number | Expected total pay across all days + WOT + unallocated |
| `expectedTotalBillRate` | number | Expected total bill across all days + WOT + unallocated |
| `jobStartDate` | number | Unix timestamp: `1751328000` |
| `jobEndDate` | number | Unix timestamp: `1753920000` |
| `timesheetFrequency` | number | `2` (biweekly) or `3` (weekly) |
| `timesheetStartDay` | number | `1` (Monday) |
| `payCurrencyId` | number | `53` |
| `billCurrencyId` | number | `53` |
| `isUnplannedHoursPayEnabled` | number | `0` (unallocated unpaid) or `1` (unallocated paid at 1x) |

### actualWorkTime Format

**Single entry, single day:**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-21:00]"
```

**Multiple entries same day (semicolon-separated):**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-17:00; 17:00-20:00]"
```

**Multiple days (comma-separated):**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-21:00, Tue: 9:00-17:00, Wed: 9:00-20:00]"
```

**7-day week including weekend:**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-17:00, Tue: 9:00-17:00, ..., Sat: 9:00-15:00, Sun: 9:00-13:00]"
```

### breakTime Format

**Single break:**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-21:00:[12:00-13:00]]"
```

**Multi-day breaks:**
```
"Week1: [Mon: 9:00-21:00:[12:00-13:00], Tue: 9:00-21:00:[12:00-13:00]]"
```

**No break:** `""`

### acceptedPayBillRate Format

Each day lists its rule allocations. Pay/bill values are the final calculated amounts.

**Range-based rules only (BS+AS):**
```
"Mon:[beforeShift:[pay,bill], regularHours:[pay,bill], afterShift:[pay,bill]]"
```

**With SR:**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[pay,bill], specificHoursRange:[pay,bill]]"
```

**With DOT (embedded in daily payBill):**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[pay,bill], dailyOT:[pay,bill]]"
```

**With unallocatedHours (when `isUnplannedHoursPayEnabled: 1`):**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[pay,bill], unallocatedHours:[pay,bill]]"
"Mon:[beforeShift:[pay,bill], regularHours:[pay,bill], unallocatedHours:[pay,bill]]"
"Mon:[regularHours:[pay,bill], dailyOT:[pay,bill], unallocatedHours:[pay,bill]]"
```

**Multi-day:**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[8,16], dailyOT:[3,6]], Tue:[regularHours:[8,16], dailyOT:[0,0]]"
```

**Multi-day with unallocatedHours:**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[8,16], unallocatedHours:[2,4]], Tue:[regularHours:[8,16], unallocatedHours:[0,0]]"
```

**Weekend (day off, no regular):**
```
"Sat:[regularHours:[0,0], dailyOT:[0,0]]"
"Sat:[regularHours:[0,0], unallocatedHours:[6,12]]"  // Weekend work, no rules
```

**With Break (BPN):**
```
"Mon:[regularHours:[6,12], Break:[0,0], unallocatedHours:[2,4]]"
```

### weeklyOT Format (separate field, only present when WOT rule exists)

```
"weeklyOT": "Week1:[pay, bill]"
```

When WOT=0: `"Week1:[0,0]"`

### rulesApplied Format Reference

| Rule | Format |
|------|--------|
| Before Shift | `BeforeShift:[multiplier: M, time: HH:MM, appliedDay:[days]]` |
| After Shift | `AfterShift:[multiplier: M, time: HH:MM, appliedDay:[days]]` |
| Specific Hours Range | `SpecificHoursRange:[multiplier: M, range:HH:MM-HH:MM, appliedDay:[days]]` |
| Daily Overtime | `DailyOT:[multiplier: M, threshold:>N, appliedDay:[days]]` |
| Weekly Overtime | `WeeklyOT:[multiplier: M, threshold:>N, appliedDay:[mon,tue,wed,thu,fri,sat,sun]]` |

Multiple rules are comma-separated in `rulesApplied`.

