## 13. Test ID Naming Convention

### Pattern
```
{RULE_COMBO}_{NNN}           — NoBrk test
{RULE_COMBO}_BPN_{NNN}       — Break Pay No test
{RULE_COMBO}_BPY_{NNN}       — Break Pay Yes test
```

### Rule Combo Codes

| Code | Combination |
|------|-------------|
| `BS_AS` | Before Shift + After Shift |
| `BS_SR` | Before Shift + Specific Hours Range |
