### Comment Convention
```
"_comment": "NoBrk: 9-21(12h). reg=8, gap=4. toward=12>10, DOT=min(2,4)=2. 12>8, WOT=min(4,2)=2."
"_comment": "UseCase1: BS(1.5x)+BPN ant=2h, no break taken. BS=2h, reg=6h, unalloc=4h."
```
Always include: break mode, work range, hours, key calculation steps. For unallocated hours tests, include the unallocated amount and source (gap, freed, etc.).

