## 14. Calculation Formulas Reference

### Pay and Bill
```
Pay = Hours × payRate × Pay_Multiplier
Bill = Hours × billRate × Bill_Multiplier
```

### Regular Hours
```
effective_regular = scheduled_regular − anticipated_break
reg_paid = min(actual_work_in_range, effective_regular)
```

### Before Shift / After Shift / Specific Range
```
hours = actual work within rule's time window
Pay = hours × payRate × rule_multiplier
Bill = hours × billRate × rule_multiplier
```

### BPN Break Impact
```
toward = total_clocked − actual_break
freed = max(0, anticipated − actual_break)
unallocated_pool = gap_hours + freed_hours
```

### Daily Overtime
```
Gate: toward > DOT_threshold?
  YES → DOT = min(toward − threshold, unallocated_pool)
  NO  → DOT = 0 (excess is unpaid)
```

### Weekly Overtime
```
weekly_toward = sum of daily toward values
WOT = min(weekly_toward − WOT_threshold, total_weekly_remaining_unallocated)
```

### DOT + WOT Together
```
DOT = min(toward − DOT_threshold, unallocated_pool)
remaining = unallocated_pool − DOT
WOT = min(weekly_toward − WOT_threshold, remaining)
gap_band = min(toward, DOT_threshold) − effective_regular  // → goes to WOT
```

### expectedTotalPayRate / expectedTotalBillRate
```
total_pay = sum of all daily (reg_pay + BS_pay + AS_pay + SR_pay + DOT_pay + unalloc_pay) + WOT_pay
total_bill = sum of all daily (reg_bill + BS_bill + AS_bill + SR_bill + DOT_bill + unalloc_bill) + WOT_bill
```

**Note:** `unalloc_pay` and `unalloc_bill` are only included when `isUnplannedHoursPayEnabled: 1`.

### Unallocated Hours
```
unallocated = total_worked − actual_break − regular_paid − BS_hours − AS_hours − SR_hours − DOT_hours − WOT_hours
Unalloc Pay = unallocated × payRate × 1
Unalloc Bill = unallocated × billRate × 1
```

### Overtime Hours Tracking
```
overtimeHours = pay_value / (payRate × multiplier)  // For each custom OT rule
totalOvertimeHours = sum of overtimeHours values (excludes WOT)
weeklyOvertimeHours = WOT_pay / (payRate × WOT_multiplier)
```

